## Verification Plan

### Automated (Python)

```bash
# Install deps
pip install pandas pydantic pytest

# Run tests
pytest pipeline/tests/ -v
```

Tests to write:
- `test_ptat_parser.py` — parses the existing `FF_Dawntrail...csv`, asserts correct column extraction, power/freq/temp means within realistic ranges
- `test_sku_map.py` — asserts `"ARL HX (SBGA)"` → `"arl-hx"` for all known SKU name strings
- `test_schema_validation.py` — asserts Pydantic raises on missing/renamed columns

### Manual (Browser)

After running the pipeline and serving the app (`npm run dev`):

1. Open [http://localhost:5173](http://localhost:5173)
2. Navigate to any program — SKU cards should show real Performance Index numbers (not seeded)
3. Click a game with real data — GameCard should show real avgFps / 1%Low numbers
4. Open Detailed Analysis — FrameTime chart should show real frame distribution (not smooth synthetic curve)
5. Switch builds in sidebar — numbers should update and show real deltas (not ±3% synthetic progression)
6. Any game without real data yet should still render (falling back to synthetic data, not crashing)
